Note that the defender scores 5 automatic victory points so long as they have at least 1 unit of troops still fighting at the end of the game.

## Victory Point Schedule

Instead of using the victory points from each edition (5th and Old World) we have combined them into one victory point schedule that aligns both editions with some rebalancing.  Note that these victory points intentionally buff taking core units, infantry units and slightly nerf other types of units.  This is intentional.$md$, 'old-world-reference', 3, s.id from public.seasons s where s.slug = 'old-world-campaign'
